OL,3,GNEWSAFA Cup dreams kick off with Humber
OL,4,ABridge derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FDreams of reaching the next round of
OL,7,Fone of the world's most prestigious
OL,8,Ffootball competitions have hit two
OL,9,Ffootball clubs, separated by eight
OL,10,Fmiles (5km) and the Humber Estuary.
OL,12,FThe first qualifying round of the FA
OL,13,FCup will take place later with North
OL,14,FFerriby Football Club and Barton Town
OL,15,Fcontesting a "Humber Bridge derby" with
OL,16,Fhopes of taking a step closer to
OL,17,FWembley.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
