OL,3,GNEWSAFA Cup dreams kick off with Humber
OL,4,ABridge derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clubs, separated by a bridge which
OL,7,Fwas once the longest of its kind
OL,8,Fanywhere in the world, are expecting a
OL,9,Fbumper crowd at the Church Road ground
OL,10,Fin East Yorkshire.
OL,12,F"There's a lot of needle in this one,"
OL,13,FBarton chairman Joe Lamplough laughs.
OL,14,F"There's a lot to play for, it's a
OL,15,Fcompetitive level and it's going to be
OL,16,Fbrilliant.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
